/E (The development of agentic artificial intelligence \(Agentic AI\) is altering the current state of data analytics. This lets companies use autonomous AI agents for data analysis, decision-making, and real-time action. Unlike traditional systems, agentic artificial intelligence systems process data autonomously, conclude, and make decisions with minimal human intervention. Businesses can automate complex tasks and shorten decision cycles by responding flexibly to real-time data streams, improving operational efficiency.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
