/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This significant analytical gap necessitates a paradigm shift towards automated, proactive operational intelligence. Advanced systems are required to process this data, infer complex implications, and autonomously execute actions. This strategic imperative directly drives the adoption of sophisticated AI-driven solutions, often Large Language Models \(LLMs\) for natural language understanding and complex reasoning, and Generative AI for synthesizing insights or formulating dynamic responses. Gartner predicts that by 2025, 75% of enterprises will rely on AI-driven self-supported systems to process real-time data, confirming this fundamental transition towards autonomous processes.)
