1393 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Unfortunately, the quick ascent of Artificial Intelligence has been accompanied by a "terminology maze," where the term "AI" is liberally applied across marketing, product descriptions, and technical discourse. While this widespread adoption highlights AI's growing importance, it blurs the lines between genuinely innovative, autonomous systems and more conventional, rule-based automation. This extensive, often imprecise, naming has created confusion, making it difficult to differentiate between traditional AI, non-agentic AI, and true agentic systems.)
/E (Unfortunately, the quick ascent of Artificial Intelligence has been accompanied by a "terminology maze," where the term "AI" is liberally applied across marketing, product descriptions, and technical discourse. While this widespread adoption highlights AI's growing importance, it blurs the lines between genuinely innovative, autonomous systems and more conventional, rule-based automation. This extensive, often imprecise, naming has created confusion, making it difficult to differentiate between traditional AI, non-agentic AI, and true agentic systems.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1394 0 obj
<<
