/S /H3
/T (Understanding these distinctions is paramount for any organization looking to leverage AI effectively. Clarity matters because knowing what each type of AI can achieve is crucial for selecting the correct solutions for your specific needs, avoiding inflated expectations, and unlocking the technology's potential.)
