1417 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Robotic Process Automation \(RPA\) often comes to mind when discussing automation in business processes. RPA tools are excellent for automating highly repetitive, rule-based tasks that interact with structured data, often mimicking human clicks and keyboard inputs across various software applications. Think of it as a digital robot following a pre-defined script, such as processing invoices in a specific format or extracting specific data fields from a web page by following precise navigational steps. RPA glows where processes are stable, predictable, and follow a "recipe.")
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
1418 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (However, the limitations of RPA become apparent when confronted with unstructured data or dynamic environments, and RPA breaks down because it lacks the capacity for reasoning or adaptation. Agentic AI, on the other hand, can:)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
