1423 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In essence, RPA automates tasks by following explicit rules. In contrast, Agentic AI automates intelligence and decision-making within a process, offering greater flexibility, resilience, and problem-solving capability. While distinct, they can be highly complementary: an Agentic AI might decide what needs to be done and how to approach it, and then dispatch an RPA bot to perform a specific, structured sub-task within that broader strategy.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [8]
