/E (Like OpenAI's GPT series or Google's Bard/Gemini, LLMs are sophisticated tools primarily designed for language understanding and generation. Their core capability lies in predicting the most probable sequence of words given a prompt, enabling them to summarize text, translate languages, answer questions, write creative content, and even generate code.  They are fundamentally reactive, responding to inputs with highly coherent and contextually relevant linguistic output.)
