/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Agentic AI acts as the autonomous orchestrator, drawing heavily on principles like Reinforcement Learning and Problem Solving \(as depicted in the AI hierarchy\). It defines goals, monitors environments, and makes strategic decisions. Its core function is to learn from past experiences and feedback, continuously adapting its approach to achieve objectives with minimal human oversight.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1455 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
