1457 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The synergy: The Agentic AI analyzes the broader context and intent \(e.g., customer sentiment, operational metrics\). When a linguistic task is required, it prompts the LLM for precise generation. Conversely, the LLM's output and subsequent human feedback are fed back to the Agentic AI, which then learns, refines its decision-making policies, and optimizes future interactions. This dynamic loop, adopting Machine Learning principles for continuous improvement, transforms reactive systems into self-optimizing, proactive solutions, enhancing accuracy and overall customer satisfaction.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
