1463 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The emergence of Agentic AI represents a key development from purely analytical or predictive AI paradigms to prescriptive and autonomous AI systems. This breakthrough fundamentally alters how organizations approach complex problem-solving and big data analytics. By intricately adopting advanced machine learning \(ML\) frameworks, Large Language Models \(LLMs\), Generative AI \(Gen AI\) capabilities, and Robotic Process Automation \(RPA\), Agentic AI is rapidly becoming an indispensable component across diverse sectors. This chapter presents into the intrinsic principles that define Agentic AI, providing a granular understanding of its operational mechanics and transformative implications for global industries.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [3]
>>
