/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Furthermore, in the Robotic Process Automation \(RPA\) context, Agentic AI transforms RPA from a rigid, rule-following bot into an intelligent, adaptive executor. While RPA executes repetitive, structured business processes \(e.g., data entry, invoice processing, report generation\) via user interface manipulation, Agentic AI provides the cognitive layer. It leverages its machine learning capabilities \(including LLMs for understanding unstructured inputs\) to make the higher-level decisions on what RPA task to perform, when to perform it, and how to adapt if exceptions occur. This synergistic integration enables automation of complex, end-to-end business processes, reducing human error, enhancing throughput, and freeing human capital for more strategic, high-value activities that require complex reasoning or emotional intelligence.)
/E (Furthermore, in the Robotic Process Automation \(RPA\) context, Agentic AI transforms RPA from a rigid, rule-following bot into an intelligent, adaptive executor. While RPA executes repetitive, structured business processes \(e.g., data entry, invoice processing, report generation\) via user interface manipulation, Agentic AI provides the cognitive layer. It leverages its machine learning capabilities \(including LLMs for understanding unstructured inputs\) to make the higher-level decisions on what RPA task to perform, when to perform it, and how to adapt if exceptions occur. This synergistic integration enables automation of complex, end-to-end business processes, reducing human error, enhancing throughput, and freeing human capital for more strategic, high-value activities that require complex reasoning or emotional intelligence.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [2]
