1789 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Bias in AI models is a primary ethical concern, with 70% of AI models affected \(Forbes\). Bias arises from non-representative data, leading to unfair decisions in healthcare and employment. To mitigate this, businesses should diversify training data and use techniques like Bias Detection Algorithms and Adversarial Debiasing to ensure fairer, less biased AI systems.)
/Pg 51 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
