1792 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The rise of autonomous AI has raised transparency concerns, with 70% of firms struggling to understand AI decisions \(Gartner\). This lack of clarity undermines trust, especially in regulated sectors. To address this, explainable AI \(XAI\) using SHAP and LIME can help businesses clarify decisions, foster trust and ensure regulatory compliance.)
/Pg 51 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
