1794 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Generative AI and LLMs handle vast amounts of sensitive data, raising privacy and security concerns. McKinsey reports that 64% of organizations see data privacy as the top AI concern, with 40% of data breaches linked to AI mishandling. To address this, businesses should implement federated learning, differential privacy, and encryption to protect data. RPA can automate privacy compliance, and strong data access rules, continuous monitoring, and encryption can prevent breaches.)
/Pg 51 0 R
/K [6]
>>
