/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (As AI systems grow more powerful, ethical AI development practices are crucial for fairness, accountability, and transparency. While 77% of AI practitioners agree on the importance of ethical guidelines, only 47% of organizations have formal frameworks. To build ethical AI, businesses should establish AI ethics committees, integrate multi-disciplinary teams, and follow clear guidelines to prevent harm, inequality, or privacy breaches. Continuous ethics training is essential to keep development teams aligned with evolving standards.)
