/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Agentic AI uses RPA, LLMs, and ML to handle and analyze enormous datasets in real time. This automation employs predictive analytics to provide actionable insights, improve operational efficiency, and minimize human error. Agentic AI design relies on autonomous decision-making, dynamic learning, and human-free action execution. Agentic AI improves real-world predictions using supervised, unsupervised, and reinforcement learning models. Scalability is a significant benefit of agentic AI. As models powered by LLMs can manage larger datasets, ensuring smooth operations without additional resources. Scalability speeds up data processing and reaction times, improving company efficiency and decision-making.)
/Pg 67 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1948 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (RPA frees human resources to work on more important tasks by automating repetitive, rule-based activities. Agentic AI's real-time feedback loops discover operational inefficiencies and improve decision-making accuracy, providing progress. For Agentic AI to work well, businesses need fast data pipelines for real-time data ingestion, validation, and preparation. Xcelligen helps firms combine these technologies to scale, make data-driven decisions, and prosper long-term.)
/Pg 67 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
